\midrule
72 & 6219.14 & 86.5\% & 53.3\% & 6.7\% \\
63 & 5322.19 & 86.5\% & 60.4\% & 6.7\% \\
54 & 4530.88 & 86.5\% & 69.7\% & 6.7\% \\
